### Scénarios de test DTO / validation / erreurs (client HTTP d'IntelliJ ou Postman)
### Base : http://localhost:8080/api  (context-path = /api)
### Prérequis : au moins une réservation en base (id 1) sans contrat.

### 1. Liste des contrats (DTO) -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contrats

### 2. Création valide -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contrats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateSignature": "2026-11-01",
  "montantTotal": 450.00,
  "valide": true,
  "reservationId": 1
}

### 3. Détail d'un contrat -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contrats/1

### 4. Contrat inexistant -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contrats/999

### 5. Validation : champs manquants -> 400 (détail par champ)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contrats
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6. Validation : montant négatif + date future -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contrats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateSignature": "2030-01-01",
  "montantTotal": -10,
  "valide": true,
  "reservationId": 1
}

### 7. JSON / date mal formés -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contrats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateSignature": "01/11/2026",
  "montantTotal": 450,
  "valide": true,
  "reservationId": 1
}

### 8. Réservation inexistante -> 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contrats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateSignature": "2026-11-01",
  "montantTotal": 450,
  "valide": true,
  "reservationId": 999
}

### 9. Réservation déjà liée à un contrat (rejouer la requête 2) -> 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contrats
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateSignature": "2026-11-01",
  "montantTotal": 450,
  "valide": true,
  "reservationId": 1
}

### 10. Mise à jour valide -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/contrats/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dateSignature": "2026-11-02",
  "montantTotal": 500.00,
  "valide": false,
  "reservationId": 1
}

### 11. Identifiant du mauvais type -> 400
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contrats/abc

### 12. Suppression -> 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/contrats/1

### 13. Paiements (DTO, lecture seule) -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/paiements

### 14. Paiement inexistant -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/paiements/999

### 15. Méthode non supportée -> 405
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/paiements/1

### ===== Autres entités (DTO + validation) =====

### 16. Agence valide -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/agences
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "AutoLoc Tunis", "ville": "Tunis", "adresse": "Av. Habib Bourguiba", "telephone": "71123456" }

### 17. Agence invalide (nom vide, téléphone incorrect) -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/agences
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "", "telephone": "abc" }

### 18. Client invalide (email incorrect, date future) -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "Ben Ali", "email": "pas-un-email", "dateInscription": "2030-01-01" }

### 19. Employé : rôle inconnu -> 400 ; agence inexistante -> 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/employes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nom": "Trabelsi", "role": "DIRECTEUR" }

### 20. Équipement valide -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/equipements
Content-Type: application/json

{ "libelle": "GPS" }

### 21. Véhicule valide -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules
Content-Type: application/json

{ "immatriculation": "123 TUN 4567", "marque": "Peugeot", "modele": "208",
  "categorie": "CITADINE", "tarifJournalier": 80.00, "statut": "DISPONIBLE",
  "agenceId": 1, "equipementIds": [1] }

### 22. Véhicule invalide (champs manquants, tarif négatif) -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules
Content-Type: application/json

{ "marque": "Peugeot", "tarifJournalier": -5 }

### 23. Véhicule : immatriculation en double -> 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vehicules
Content-Type: application/json

{ "immatriculation": "123 TUN 4567", "marque": "Renault", "modele": "Clio",
  "categorie": "CITADINE", "tarifJournalier": 70, "statut": "DISPONIBLE" }

### 24. Réservation : date de fin avant début -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dateDebut": "2026-12-10", "dateFin": "2026-12-01", "statut": "EN_ATTENTE",
  "vehiculeId": 1, "clientId": 1 }

### 25. Maintenance valide -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/maintenances
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dateDebut": "2026-12-01", "dateFin": "2026-12-03", "description": "Vidange", "vehiculeId": 1 }
